flowchart TB
    subgraph Users["Users of Gestión Neiva"]
        Tendero["Tendero (Store Owner)<br/>Manages catalog, pricing, reports & voice assistant"]
        Cajero["Cajero (Cashier)<br/>Scans barcodes & executes POS checkout"]
        SuperAdmin["Platform SuperAdmin<br/>Manages tenant accounts, plans & support tickets"]
    end

    subgraph System["SaaS Platform"]
        GestionNeiva["Gestión Neiva (TiendApp)<br/>Single Deployable Modular Monolith<br/>FastAPI + PostgreSQL + React SPA"]
    end

    subgraph External["External Services"]
        Groq["Groq Cloud API<br/>Whisper Large v3 (Fast STT ~150ms)"]
        Gemini["Google Gemini API<br/>Gemini 1.5 / 2.0 Flash (LLM intent & STT fallback)"]
        WhatsApp["Meta WhatsApp Cloud API<br/>Account linking & async notifications"]
        Hosting["Cloud Infrastructure<br/>Render (API), Vercel (SPA), Supabase (PostgreSQL)"]
    end

    Tendero -->|Manages store & speaks voice commands| GestionNeiva
    Cajero -->|Scans products & processes sales| GestionNeiva
    SuperAdmin -->|Resolves tickets & audits tenants| GestionNeiva

    GestionNeiva -->|Sends voice audio for STT| Groq
    GestionNeiva -->|Sends prompts for conversational intent| Gemini
    GestionNeiva -->|Verifies phone numbers| WhatsApp
    GestionNeiva -->|Deploys and persists state on| Hosting
